//! Test-only crate: the integration tests under `tests/` compare the
//! generated Rust bid754 implementation against the Intel BID C oracle
//! (libbid-sys, which links the repo-local `libbid.a`). This crate stays
//! repo-internal (`publish = false`) so the publishable `bid754` crate
//! carries no path-only FFI dependency.
//!
//! - `tests/readtest_generated.rs` is generated by
//!   `tools/codegen --target=readtest-rust`; do not edit it directly.
//! - `tests/tier1_*_long_generated.rs` are emitted by `testgen` from the same
//!   Tier 1 boundary, semantic, operation, and deterministic-input model as
//!   the Go long runners and are enabled by the `tier1-long` feature.
//! - `tests/fuzz_vs_c.rs` is the randomized Rust-vs-C complement, gated
//!   behind the `ffi-fuzz` feature.
